# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR[[cite:obs-63478a78e7b78e4e297dcefbc93fd77917c123e2 "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]].

Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director[[cite:obs-2cb73123af340460cd779fac89ffd6f31a1298a2 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
